Input: {"question": "When was the People's University established?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "start": 0, "end": 176, "text": "People's University of Amsterdam The People's University of Amsterdam also known as Volks Universiteit Amsterdam or Folk University, is a course centre for adults in Amsterdam."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "start": 177, "end": 384, "text": "In 1784, the Dutch Maatschappij tot Nut van 't Algemeen was founded and around 1900 there were about 20 so-called Toynbee-associations to English example adult education offered to the lowest social classes."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "start": 385, "end": 479, "text": "Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam was founded in 1913 and has various course locations in Amsterdam."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "start": 480, "end": 605, "text": "Since 2016 the Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam works together with the Amsterdam Public Library (Openbare Bibliotheek Amsterdam)."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "start": 606, "end": 712, "text": "The American Chautauqua Institution, originally the Chautauqua Lake Sunday School Assembly, was founded in"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01", "start": 0, "end": 158, "text": "message ) The People 's University of Amsterdam , also known as Volks Universiteit Amsterdam or Folk University , is a course centre for adults in Amsterdam ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01", "start": 159, "end": 252, "text": "Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam was founded in 1913 and has multiple study centres in Amsterdam ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01", "start": 253, "end": 394, "text": "Since 2016 , the Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam has been working together with the Amsterdam Public Library ( Openbare Bibliotheek Amsterdam ) ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01", "start": 395, "end": 613, "text": "[ 1 ] [ 2 ] International analogues [ edit ] The American Chautauqua Institution , originally the Chautauqua Lake Sunday School Assembly , was founded in 1874 `` as an educational experiment in out-of-school , vacation"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 0, "end": 10, "text": "learning ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 11, "end": 161, "text": "It was broadened almost immediately beyond courses for Sunday school teachers to include academic subjects , music , art , and physical education '' ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 162, "end": 284, "text": "[ 3 ] In the Netherlands the Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam was founded in 1913 by the Maatschappij tot Nut va n't Algemeen ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 285, "end": 329, "text": "Today there are about 61 Volksuniversities ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 330, "end": 381, "text": "[ 4 ] In Flanders they are called Volkshogeschool ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 382, "end": 498, "text": "[ 5 ] The Freie Deutsche Hochschule ( Germany ) was founded in Paris on November 19 , 1935 as an exile institution ."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d02", "start": 499, "end": 570, "text": "The teaching followed the ideological requirements of the popular front"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 0, "end": 148, "text": "People's University of Bangladesh The People's University of Bangladesh or PUB is a non-profit educational institution located at Dhaka, Bangladesh."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 149, "end": 314, "text": "It was established on 14 May 1996 as a private university under the Private University Act 1992 with a view to expanding the scope of higher education in Bangladesh."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 315, "end": 431, "text": "The university has two own campuses, one at Mohammadpur and the other one located at Sristighar, Shibpur, Narsingdi."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 432, "end": 480, "text": "Mr.Shirazul Islam Mollah is the chairman of PUB."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 481, "end": 573, "text": "The University Grants Commission (UGC) of Bangladesh has approved its syllabi and curricula."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d03", "start": 574, "end": 643, "text": "The first convocation was held on 29 October 2007 at Bangladesh China"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d04", "start": 0, "end": 32, "text": "from the state education system."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d04", "start": 33, "end": 168, "text": "The institution was founded on September 16, 1940, following the education philosophy of President Lázaro Cárdenas del Río (1934–1940)."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d04", "start": 169, "end": 398, "text": "Given the young feel of Colima, the governor, Colonel Pedro Torres Ortiz (1939–1943), commissioned the project of what was later to be University Public Education Director General, Lieutenant Colonel and Professor Rubén Vizcarra."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d04", "start": 399, "end": 528, "text": "Currently enrollment is 12,367 students in high school, 10,214 in professional and associate degrees, and 604 in graduate school."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d04", "start": 529, "end": 670, "text": "The university offers 17 options in the high school level, ten of APO, 58 degree, 11 specialties, 22 master's degrees and 9 doctoral degrees,"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d05", "start": 0, "end": 122, "text": "Finally , the municipality of Manzanillo has facilities in the towns of San Pedrito , Valle de las Garzas and El Naranjo ."}, "D6S2": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d05", "start": 123, "end": 384, "text": "It was created 16 of September of 1940 being president of Mexico Lázaro Cárdenas of the River , was inaugurated with the name of Popular University of Colima ; Its objective : to meet the educational needs demanded by the states Michoacán , Jalisco and Colima ."}, "D6S3": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d05", "start": 385, "end": 562, "text": "Show more Education programs Bachelor 27 Master 13 PhD 5 Accounting ~ $ 1,400 / year Bachelor of Accounting Spanish Language of instructions Full-time Study mode $ 1,400 Fee for"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d06", "start": 0, "end": 247, "text": "of Amsterdam , [ 183 ] with the country 's five largest law firms and several subsidiaries of large consulting firms , such as Boston Consulting Group and Accenture , as well as the World Trade Centre ( Amsterdam ) located in the Zuidas district ."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d06", "start": 248, "end": 380, "text": "In addition to the Zuidas , there are three smaller financial districts in Amsterdam : around Amsterdam Sloterdijk railway station ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d06", "start": 381, "end": 458, "text": "Where one can find the offices of several newspapers , such as De Telegraaf ."}, "D7S4": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d06", "start": 459, "end": 566, "text": "as well as those of Deloitte , the Gemeentelijk Vervoerbedrijf ( municipal public transport company ) , and"}, "D8S1": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "learn as you go ."}, "D8S2": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 18, "end": 124, "text": "As an example , the class usually takes the professor out to eat after the last class period of a course ."}, "D8S3": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 125, "end": 251, "text": "All classes are conducted completely in Spanish and you will be expected to speak , understand , and present in the language ."}, "D8S4": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 252, "end": 358, "text": "Students should not attempt to study in this program without a strong background in the Spanish language ."}, "D8S5": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 359, "end": 461, "text": "There are , of course , students in the class who will speak English and a few who speak it fluently ."}, "D8S6": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d07", "start": 462, "end": 511, "text": "Other Activities � ( Back to top ) The university"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d00:c0", "entity": "Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam", "scope": "People's University of Amsterdam", "claim": "Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam was founded in 1913.", "answer": "1913", "quote": "Volksuniversiteit Amsterdam was founded in 1913 and has various course locations in Amsterdam.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0471-01dddf437139:d01:c0", "entity": "People's University of Amsterdam", "scope": "founding date", "claim": "T